@startuml
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor black
  ActorBorderColor black
  LifeLineBorderColor black
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #FDF6E3
  NoteBackgroundColor #EEE8D5
  NoteBorderColor black
}

title UAE PASS → Digital Dirham App → LFI Keycloak (Token Exchange via Credential Flow)

actor User
participant "Digital Dirham App" as App
participant "Embedded WebView" as WebView
participant "System URL Manager" as URLMgr
participant "UAE PASS App" as UAEPASS
participant "LFI Keycloak" as KC
autonumber 
User -> App : Launches Digital Dirham App

App -> KC: get redirect URL to UAEPASS 
KC -> App: redirect Login url
App -> WebView : Open UAE PASS login URL
note right
  🔗 <color:blue>https://stg-id.uaepass.ae/idshub/authorize?</color>  
  <color:green>acr_values=urn:digitalid:authentication:flow:mobileondevice</color>  
  <color:purple>&client_id=sandbox_stage</color>  
  <color:orange>&redirect_uri=https://stg-selfcare.uaepass.ae</color>  
  <color:gold>&response_type=code</color>  
  <color:teal>&scope=urn:uae:digitalid:profile:general</color>  
  <color:red>&state=xyz</color>
end note

WebView -> UAEPASS : Monitor for deep link
note right
  🧠 Rewrite deeplink:  
  <color:blue>uaepassstg://?</color>  
  <color:orange>successURL=yourapp:///resume_authn?url=https://stg-selfcare.uaepass.ae?code=abc123</color>
end note

WebView -> URLMgr : Invoke deeplink
URLMgr -> UAEPASS : Open UAE PASS App

User -> UAEPASS : Authenticate
UAEPASS -> URLMgr : Redirect to successURL
URLMgr -> App : Resume Digital Dirham App via deep link

App -> UAEPASS : Exchange code for access token
note right
  🔄 Token Request  
  <color:blue>POST https://stg-id.uaepass.ae/idshub/token</color>  
  <color:gold>grant_type=authorization_code</color>  
  <color:purple>&client_id=sandbox_stage</color>  
  <color:orange>&redirect_uri=https://stg-selfcare.uaepass.ae</color>  
  <color:green>&code=abc123</color>
end note

UAEPASS -> App : Return access token


App -> KC : Token Exchange via Credential Flow (second Keycloak flow)
note right
  🔁 Token Exchange Request  
  <color:blue>POST /realms/myrealm/protocol/openid-connect/token</color>  
  <color:gold>grant_type=urn:ietf:params:oauth:grant-type:token-exchange</color>  
  <color:green>subject_token=uaepass_access_token</color>  
  <color:purple>subject_token_type=urn:ietf:params:oauth:token-type:access_token</color>  
  <color:orange>client_id=digidirham-client</color>  
  <color:red>client_secret=xyz123</color>  
  <color:teal>audience=internal-api</color>
end note

KC -> App : Return LFI Keycloak JWT
note right
  🧾 Response:  
  `access_token`, `expires_in`, `scope`, `issued_token_type`
end note

@enduml
